'<!-- Input form vs calculated report. Switch Form / Results in the toolbar. -->
'<h2>Simply supported beam</h2>
#pre
'<h3>Input data</h3>
#UI 'Span - 'L = 5m
#UI 'Uniform load - 'q = 10kN/m
'<p>Support</p>
#UI {"type":"dropdown","keys":["Pinned  qL²/8","Fixed  qL²/12"],"values":["8","12"]} k_M = 8
#end pre
#post
'<h3>Results</h3>
'Bending moment
M_max = q*L^2/k_M
'Shear force
V_max = q*L/2
'Mid-span deflection with EI = 1 kN·m²
δ = 5*q*L^4/(384*1kN*m^2)
#end post
